<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>During Dragon Age's development this file was automatically updated from an internal database. End user builders can update it manually.
</p><p>When making abilities the best way to proceed is to copy the nearest analogous ability and then modify the specific columns you need to.
</p>
